      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLUE DANNI (2) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4 length second (17.90) over 300m at this track. Makes plenty of appeal. MISS CHERRY PIE (3) produced a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 400m behind Bella's Star (23.25) in a Maiden. Likely to be about the money. PASSIONATE TULLY (1) produced a modest effort most recently when eighth at this track over 300m behind Global Chat (18.02) in a Maiden. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. IT'S GO TIME (7) is a Darren Rowe-trained newcomer by Tommy Shelby out of Two Mates. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles well so watch market closely.",
